+  `get_scale_min_k4_just2`, `kvalues_iq4nl_f`) @ 044dff242d78 (MIT; the license is in the file's header). One edit, listed
+  in the tool: Q4_K divides its block scale by 16 in float instead of half.
+- `kernels/common/gguf_gemv.metal` `gguf_mm` — the structure of `kernel_mul_mm` (`GGML_METAL_HAS_TENSOR` variant) @
+  044dff242d78 (MIT): weight rows dequantized per K step into threadgroup memory, multiplied with the activations in
+  device memory by MPP `matmul2d`.
+- `monolith/formats/gguf_checkpoint.py` — the inverse of `convert_hf_to_gguf.py`'s Qwen3.5 / DSpark conversions
+  (`conversion/qwen.py`: `Qwen3NextModel.modify_tensors`, `_LinearAttentionVReorderBase`, `DFlashModel`) @ 044dff242d78
+  (MIT): which tensors it renames, offsets, exponentiates and reorders.
